Install jenkins using Docker

Install Docker 

apt update
apt install -y docker.io
systemctl start docker
systemctl enable docker

Run Jenkins LTS

docker run -d \
  --name jenkins \
  -p 8080:8080 \
  -p 50000:50000 \
  -v jenkins_home:/var/jenkins_home \
  jenkins/jenkins:lts

Get password:
docker exec jenkins cat /var/jenkins_home/secrets/initialAdminPassword

